## Model Routing (Token Cost Control)

Use the right model for the right task. **General chat and non-code questions → {{platforms.general_chat_alternative}} (free tier) — do not burn Claude tokens on Q&A.** Tiers come from `governance/model-tiers.yaml` (single source of truth — no pinned vendor patch IDs here).

